    "long_instructions": "## Try Your Prompt\r\n\r\nUse AI Chat to try out the prompt you and your partner built in Step 3 of your Activity Guide.\r\n\r\n### Do This:\r\n\r\n1. Type your full prompt from Step 3 into AI Chat. Press **Send** and read AI Chat's response.\r\n2. When you and your partner are both done, compare your responses.\r\n\r\n**Try it out!**\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n",
